# GitFlow-lite

Follow [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) and the GitFlow-lite section in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

- Prefer a short-lived branch (`feature|fix|chore|docs/<area>-<name>`) over committing implementation to `main`.
- One learning-sized step per branch / PR.
- Do not introduce long-lived `develop` or `release/*` unless the human asks.
